# ECB Architecture Rule

## Layer Responsibilities
- `boundary`: external input/output adapters (UI, API, CLI).
- `control`: application/business use-case orchestration.
- `entity`: domain data, invariants, and core rules.

## Allowed Dependencies
- `boundary -> control`
- `control -> entity`

## Forbidden Dependencies
- `entity -> control`
- `entity -> boundary`
- `control -> boundary`

## Enforcement
- Keep imports aligned with dependency direction.
- Reject code that mixes responsibilities across layers.
